## Troubleshooting

| Problem | Fix |
|---------|-----|
| `kubectl get nodes` shows nothing | `aws eks update-kubeconfig --name demo-test --region ap-south-1` |
| Pod stuck in `ImagePullBackOff` | Wrong image URL or ECR login expired — recheck Step 5 |
| Pod stuck in `Pending` | Not enough node space — check `kubectl describe pod <name>` |
| `EXTERNAL-IP` stays `<pending>` | Wait 3 min; if still pending, check node IAM role |
| `exec format error` in logs | Wrong CPU arch — rebuild with `--platform linux/amd64` |
| `$REGISTRY` empty after new terminal | Re-run the 3 variable lines from Step 5b |

