## How All 4 Work Together

Once everything is set up, your production architecture looks like this:

```
Internet
   │
   ▼
┌──────────────────────────────────┐
│  Single AWS ALB                   │  ← Ingress + ALB Controller
│  (one load balancer for all)      │    saves money vs 1 LB per service
└──────────────┬────────────────────┘
               │ routes by /path
    ┌──────────┼────────────┐
    ▼          ▼            ▼
 api-svc    auth-svc    payment-svc
    │          │            │
    ▼          ▼            ▼
  Pods       Pods         Pods      ← deployed and managed via Helm charts
    │                               ← IRSA gives each pod its own IAM identity
    │                                  no hardcoded keys anywhere
    ▼
  Nodes                             ← Karpenter auto-adds/removes nodes
  (scale in/out automatically)         you pay only for what you use
```

