| Order | Topic | Why this order |
|-------|-------|----------------|
| **1st** | Helm | You use Helm to install IRSA tooling, the ALB Controller, and Karpenter. Learn this first or you'll struggle with everything else. |
| **2nd** | IRSA | Security before any service touches AWS. Establish the right pattern early — it's much harder to fix later. |
| **3rd** | Ingress + ALB Controller | Immediate cost saving. Visible, practical impact as soon as you have more than one service. |
| **4th** | Karpenter | Node-level optimization. Your app is already working well — now make the infrastructure smarter and cheaper. |

