## Full Troubleshooting Reference

| Problem | Likely Cause | Fix |
|---------|-------------|-----|
| `kubectl get nodes` empty | kubeconfig not set | `aws eks update-kubeconfig --name demo-test --region ap-south-1` |
| Pod `ImagePullBackOff` | Wrong image URL or ECR login expired | Re-run ECR login in Step 5, recheck `$REGISTRY` |
| Pod `Pending` | No node space | `kubectl describe pod <name>` — look for resource pressure |
| `EXTERNAL-IP` pending | LB not created | Wait 3 min; check node IAM role has LB permissions |
| `exec format error` | Wrong CPU arch | Rebuild: `docker build --platform linux/amd64` |
| Karpenter not launching nodes | Controller IAM role missing | Verify `KarpenterControllerPolicy` exists and IRSA is set up for controller |
| Ingress not creating ALB | ALB controller not running | `kubectl get deployment -n kube-system aws-load-balancer-controller` |
| IRSA not working | OIDC provider not enabled | `eksctl utils associate-iam-oidc-provider --cluster demo-test --approve` |
| Helm install fails | Release already exists | Use `helm upgrade --install` instead of `helm install` |

